{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人林峯《GO WITH THE FLOW》巡迴演唱會來到內地最後一站，將於12月5日在廣州舉行，為12月8日生日的他提早慶祝，早前他已率先報喜，宣布邀得重磅嘉賓古天樂與鍾嘉欣驚喜登場，重現《尋秦記》的師徒組合及《家好月圓》的經典螢幕情侶。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.584601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:26.701512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:26.701512+00:00","content_hash":"19a12ec2dab47af34163b3be6c84cb5820df0ae24c2158c9df6e605e84e549d5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}